message: "If you use this repository, please cite the associated paper and the original model implementations."
type: software
title: "On the Transferability Between Extreme Multi-Label and Hierarchical Text Classification"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FloHauss/XMC_HTC"
abstract: >-
  Research software for a cross-domain study of established extreme multi-label
  and hierarchical text classification models, including dataset conversion,
  model integration, evaluation and reproducibility utilities.
keywords:
  - extreme multi-label classification
  - hierarchical text classification
  - transferability
  - cross-domain evaluation
